Package: chonyepicdata
Type: Package
Title: Loads, cleans, and processes CHONY EHR inpatient data from the Epic era (after 2/1/2020)
Version: 0.8
Author: Andrew Geneslaw
Maintainer: Andrew Geneslaw <asg2195@cumc.columbia.edu>
Description: Tools for loading, cleaning, and processing inpatient EHR data
    from NewYork-Presbyterian/Columbia University Irving Medical Center,
    exported from Epic (encounters after 2020-02-01). Provides functions for
    loading and standardizing labs, vitals, medications, and flowsheet data,
    as well as higher-level pipelines for clinical scoring including the
    pediatric Sequential Organ Failure Assessment (pSOFA) score and
    respiratory support classification.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
